antex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `antex fork`, `antex exec`, and `antex exec fork`
antex fork --worktree: `antex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
antex fork --worktree --last: `antex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
antex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `antex exec fork --worktree`
antex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
antex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `antex fork`, `antex exec`, and `antex exec fork`
antex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `antex fork`, `antex exec`, and `antex exec fork`
antex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `antex fork`, `antex exec`, and `antex exec fork`
